---
// Quiz figure for the Go goroutines quiz (post 07), set 01: a snapshot of the program in s01q5 after both
// worker goroutines have started. It names where each goroutine's current statement is and the WaitGroup
// counter. It draws no arrows and no verdict.
// Inline SVG, site tokens only, no <marker>/<defs>/ids.
---
<div class="qfig-gq07ws">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 270" role="img" aria-label="Snapshot of a program with three goroutines and an unbuffered channel of int. The main goroutine is at wg.Wait with the WaitGroup counter at 2. Worker 1 and worker 2 are each at the statement ch <- w * 10.">
    <text x="0" y="18" class="qfig-gq07ws-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Snapshot: both workers have started</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Ảnh chụp: cả hai worker đã chạy</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="20" y="52" class="qfig-gq07ws-m">main</text>
    <rect x="20" y="60" width="170" height="40" rx="6" class="qfig-gq07ws-box" />
    <text x="32" y="85" class="qfig-gq07ws-c">wg.Wait()</text>
    <rect x="20" y="124" width="170" height="40" rx="6" class="qfig-gq07ws-box" />
    <text x="32" y="149" class="qfig-gq07ws-c">
      <tspan data-lang-en>counter = 2</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>counter = 2</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="184" class="qfig-gq07ws-m">sync.WaitGroup</text>

    <rect x="226" y="98" width="128" height="52" rx="26" class="qfig-gq07ws-chan" />
    <text x="290" y="120" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq07ws-c">chan int</text>
    <text x="290" y="138" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq07ws-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>no buffer</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>không buffer</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="390" y="52" class="qfig-gq07ws-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>worker 1</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>worker 1</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="390" y="60" width="170" height="40" rx="6" class="qfig-gq07ws-box" />
    <text x="402" y="85" class="qfig-gq07ws-c">ch &lt;- w * 10</text>
    <text x="390" y="136" class="qfig-gq07ws-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>worker 2</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>worker 2</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="390" y="144" width="170" height="40" rx="6" class="qfig-gq07ws-box" />
    <text x="402" y="169" class="qfig-gq07ws-c">ch &lt;- w * 10</text>

    <text x="20" y="222" class="qfig-gq07ws-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Code after wg.Wait(): close(ch), then for v := range ch</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Code sau wg.Wait(): close(ch), rồi for v := range ch</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="246" class="qfig-gq07ws-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Each worker runs defer wg.Done() after its send</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi worker chạy defer wg.Done() sau lệnh gửi</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-gq07ws { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-gq07ws svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-gq07ws text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq07ws .qfig-gq07ws-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq07ws .qfig-gq07ws-m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-gq07ws .qfig-gq07ws-c { font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace); fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq07ws-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-gq07ws-chan { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--act-3); stroke-width: 2; }
</style>
